From: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] meta-rz-bsp: move wic/*.wks into files/wic

oe-core searches for .wks files under <layer>/files/wic, per
WKS_SEARCH_PATH in classes-recipe/image_types_wic.bbclass. A layer-root
wic/ directory is not on that path, so the three .wks files named by the
meta-rz-bsp machine confs are unreachable where they sit.

Since Yocto 5.1 that layout is also a hard sanity failure:
classes-global/sanity.bbclass raises "wic/wks files at <path> need to be
moved to files/wic within the layer to be found/used" for any BBPATH or
BBLAYERS entry carrying a layer-root wic/. The check runs from
check_sanity_version_change, which only fires when SANITY_VERSION or
NATIVELSBSTRING differs from build/cache/sanity_info -- so an existing
build directory never sees it and only a fresh one fails, permanently:
sanity_info is written only when there are no messages.

Moving the files satisfies the check and makes the machine confs'
WKS_FILE values resolve, on both scarthgap and wrynose.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Assisted-by: claude-code:claude-opus-5[1m]
---
 meta-rz-bsp/{ => files}/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd-pmic.wks | 0
 meta-rz-bsp/{ => files}/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd.wks      | 0
 meta-rz-bsp/{ => files}/wic/rz-image-bootpart-mmc.wks      | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meta-rz-bsp/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd-pmic.wks b/meta-rz-bsp/files/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd-pmic.wks
similarity index 100%
rename from meta-rz-bsp/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd-pmic.wks
rename to meta-rz-bsp/files/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd-pmic.wks
diff --git a/meta-rz-bsp/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd.wks b/meta-rz-bsp/files/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd.wks
similarity index 100%
rename from meta-rz-bsp/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd.wks
rename to meta-rz-bsp/files/wic/rz-image-bootpart-esd.wks
diff --git a/meta-rz-bsp/wic/rz-image-bootpart-mmc.wks b/meta-rz-bsp/files/wic/rz-image-bootpart-mmc.wks
similarity index 100%
rename from meta-rz-bsp/wic/rz-image-bootpart-mmc.wks
rename to meta-rz-bsp/files/wic/rz-image-bootpart-mmc.wks
